# ==========================================
# Arcana Class (BG3) — private project repository
# ==========================================
# Tracked: the knowledge base (Context/), design documents (Design/ text), technical docs (Docs/),
# tools, the mod mirror (mod/), the player guides (Wiki/, Codex/), publishing texts and CLAUDE.md.
# Not tracked: heavy art, backups, the archive and scratch.

# --- Heavy art and publishing images ---
/Design/art/
/Publishing/images/
/Publishing/posters/
/Publishing/feedback/

# --- Safety copies and dead material ---
/Backups/
/_archive/
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.orig

# --- Scratch ---
/.superpowers/
/.claude/

# --- Game packed builds & binary assets ---
*.pak
*.gr2
*.dds
*.wem
*.bin

# --- OS & editor cache ---
.obsidian/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
node_modules/
